From b7f03b0e02dc680f270902857d219d5f744c89f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SWG Local Dev <swg-local@localhost>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 04:58:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Sandbox Hoth: reward loot (Bellum Gero, AGPL-3.0) on Hoth's
 creatures

Owner, 14 Oct: port Bellum's Hoth reward loot as the next Hoth slice.
- 25 of Bellum's 163 Hoth loot items: the ones whose objects our client has
  (tools/hoth/hoth_loot_inventory.py + hoth_loot_core3_check.py). 7 Hoth
  decorations and 18 vehicle deeds; items unchanged, under loot/items/hoth.
- Groups hoth_decor_common (4), hoth_decor_rare (3), hoth_vehicle_deeds (18):
  Bellum's groups cut to those items, equal weights.
- Core3-dev already registers every needed object under custom_content except
  two deeds (Organa speeder, Sith speeder); those come from Bellum, Core3 style.
- Drops (our design; tunable): ordinary Hoth life 3% common decor; sergeants
  and named beasts 5% rare decor; named beasts 2% a vehicle deed.
- Rest (138 items: Bellum's art, ice decor, paintings, snow-armour and vehicle
  schematics, 11 deeds) need client objects only Bellum's private archive has.
Generated by tools/hoth/hoth_port_loot.py; luac5.3 -p clean; group weights
total 10,000,000. Not yet tried in game. The client also needs the merged
object CRC table now in local_planets.tre (MTG's objects are otherwise unnamed).

Agent: Claude
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
